    <bpmn:process id="W_W5362" name="W5362. Latex Paint Reblending, Donation-to-Community &amp; Reuse-Product Sales Channel" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Usable latex paint identified at take-back (W5353)
Frequency: ~20–40% of latex take-back is reusable
Volume: ~60k–200k liters reblended/yr
Owner: Sustainability/ESG Manager
Participants: Reblending Partner, CSR/Foundation (VS-152), Paint Dept, Pricing (VS-57)
Source: workflow W5362 — Latex Paint Reblending, Donation-to-Community &amp; Reuse-Product Sales Channel</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5362_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5362_Lane1" name="Reblending Partner">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5362_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5362_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5362_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5362_Lane2" name="Sustainability">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5362_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5362_Lane3" name="Paint Dept">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5362_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5362_Lane4" name="Finance Business Partner">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5362_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5362_End12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5362_Start6" name="Usable latex paint identified at take-back (W5353)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5362_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5362_Task7" name="Consolidate usable latex paint at the reblending partner; blend, filter, and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Consolidate usable latex paint at the reblending partner; blend, filter, and standardize into a limited color range.
Responsible (R): Reblending Partner
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: per batch</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5362_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5362_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5362_Task8" name="QA the reblended paint (coverage, adhesion, VOC); label as reblended/recycled…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: QA the reblended paint (coverage, adhesion, VOC); label as reblended/recycled product.
Responsible (R): Reblending Partner
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: per batch</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5362_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5362_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5362_Task9" name="Route to the preferred channel: donation to community housing/disaster-recovery…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Route to the preferred channel: donation to community housing/disaster-recovery (VS-152/VS-180) or sale as a value recycled product.
Responsible (R): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: per batch</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5362_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5362_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5362_Task10" name="For sale: price and merchandise as a recycled/reblended SKU (VS-01/VS-57)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: For sale: price and merchandise as a recycled/reblended SKU (VS-01/VS-57); recognize recovery revenue.
Responsible (R): Paint Dept
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: per batch</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5362_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5362_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5362_Task11" name="Track recovery revenue and donation value for the program business case (W5368).">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Track recovery revenue and donation value for the program business case (W5368).
Responsible (R): Finance Business Partner
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5362_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5362_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5362_End12" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5362_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5362_Annotation13">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-31: NRV/quality provision on recycled stock; CTL-114 (recovery-revenue recognition accuracy).
Owner: Sustainability/ESG Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W5362_Assoc14" sourceRef="W5362_Annotation13" targetRef="W5362_Start6" associationDirection="None" />
