    <bpmn:process id="W_W5363" name="W5363. Hazardous Waste Disposal, Incineration/Cement-Kiln &amp; Landfill Diversion Tracking" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Non-recoverable hazardous waste (oil-based paint, contaminated oil, restricted pesticides, etc.)
Frequency: Per disposal batch
Volume: ~3,000–8,000 disposal batches/yr
Owner: Compliance Specialist (Environmental)
Participants: TSD Facility, HSE Officer, Sustainability/ESG Manager
Source: workflow W5363 — Hazardous Waste Disposal, Incineration/Cement-Kiln &amp; Landfill Diversion Tracking</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5363_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5363_Lane1" name="Compliance Specialist">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5363_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5363_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5363_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5363_Lane2" name="TSD Facility">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5363_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5363_Lane3" name="Sustainability">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5363_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5363_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5363_End11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5363_Start5" name="Non-recoverable hazardous waste (oil-based paint, contaminated oil, restricted…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5363_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5363_Task6" name="Confirm the stream is non-recoverable per the recovery hierarchy (reuse &gt;…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Confirm the stream is non-recoverable per the recovery hierarchy (reuse &gt; recycle &gt; energy-recovery &gt; disposal).
Responsible (R): Compliance Specialist
Accountable (A): Compliance Specialist
Duration: per batch</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5363_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5363_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5363_Task7" name="Route to the licensed disposal method: cement-kiln co-processing (energy…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Route to the licensed disposal method: cement-kiln co-processing (energy recovery), licensed incineration, or permitted hazardous-waste landfill.
Responsible (R): TSD Facility
Accountable (A): Compliance Specialist
Duration: per batch</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5363_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5363_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5363_Task8" name="Capture the disposal method and destination for the manifest close-out and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Capture the disposal method and destination for the manifest close-out and diversion tracking.
Responsible (R): Compliance Specialist
Accountable (A): Compliance Specialist
Duration: per batch</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5363_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5363_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5363_Task9" name="Track the landfill-diversion rate (diverted vs. landfilled) as a program KPI…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Track the landfill-diversion rate (diverted vs. landfilled) as a program KPI (W5368).
Responsible (R): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Accountable (A): Compliance Specialist
Duration: monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5363_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5363_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5363_Task10" name="Minimize disposal over time by improving recovery (W5361/W5362) and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Minimize disposal over time by improving recovery (W5361/W5362) and assortment/substitution.
Responsible (R): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Accountable (A): Compliance Specialist
Duration: quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5363_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5363_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
