    <bpmn:process id="W_W5367" name="W5367. Stewardship Program Cost Recovery, Co-Funding Reconciliation &amp; Vendor Settlement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly co-funding cycle; vendor invoicing for TSD services
Frequency: Monthly
Volume: ~1 reconciliation/entity/month; ~5–15 vendor invoices/month
Owner: Finance Business Partner (ESG)
Participants: Accounts Payable (VS-15), Merchandising (VS-39), Sustainability/ESG Manager
Source: workflow W5367 — Stewardship Program Cost Recovery, Co-Funding Reconciliation &amp; Vendor Settlement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5367_LaneSet3">
