Responsible (R): BI Analyst
Accountable (A): Marketing Manager
Duration: 2 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5368_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5368_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
