Responsible (R): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5368_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5368_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
